schema: "0.4"
id: npl-brutalist-01-landing-page
type: image
quality: high

# NoizuPromptLingo — a prompt-definition language & MCP toolchain for agentic work
# sessions, tickets, chat, and personas — public marketing Landing Page.
# Theme tenets: raw flat structure, zero radius, load-bearing hard borders, flat
# electric primaries, hard-offset block shadow as the only depth.
# Palette: vermilion #ff2d00, ultramarine #1500ff, hazard-yellow #ffe600,
# white #ffffff, black #000000, surface-alt #f2f2f2.
# Render note (Stage C): the literal word "machinery" pulls photographic reactor/gear
# imagery from the raster model, and "flat vector illustration" pulls a spot-illustration
# gallery + lorem ipsum — both drift off-thesis. Best kept render came from this prose;
# a future re-render should say "hard-edged UI, no photographs" WITHOUT either phrase.

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a senior product designer rendering a high-fidelity UI mockup of the
    public marketing landing page of a developer tool, in a NEO-BRUTALIST register:
    raw structure shown as machinery, never a skin over it. Loud but disciplined by a
    hard grid — confident, disruptive, unmistakable within the first second. Borders
    are load-bearing, color is pure signal, nothing is softened to be polite. Flat
    fills only: no gradient, no glow, no blur, no soft drop shadow. The single
    sanctioned depth cue is a hard-offset SOLID block shadow with zero blur. Type is
    geometric grotesk (Space Grotesk) with UPPERCASE 700 headings and Space Mono for
    labels, links, tags, and code. No serif, ever. Zero corner radius everywhere.
  text: |
    A 16:9 high-fidelity UI mockup of the LANDING / MARKETING PAGE of NoizuPromptLingo
    (wordmark "NPL"), a prompt-definition language and MCP toolchain for agentic work
    sessions, tickets, chat, and AI personas — rendered as raw, high-voltage structure.

    OVERALL LAYOUT (top to bottom on a pure white canvas, everything aligned to a hard
    12-column grid, regions separated by full-width 2px solid black rules): a bordered
    NAV BAR, a huge HERO BANNER, a four-cell FEATURE GRID, and a footer band.

    NAV BAR (top, one hard-bordered band): left, the "NPL" wordmark in heavy uppercase
    grotesk set in a solid black block with white letters; center, uppercase mono text
    links (PRODUCT, DOCS, PROTOCOL, PRICING) with no pill highlights; right, a bordered
    ghost "LOG IN" link and a solid vermilion "GET STARTED" button — rectangular, 2px
    black border, black uppercase mono label, a hard-offset black block shadow sitting
    down-and-right with zero blur.

    HERO BANNER (dominant): an enormous confident headline in uppercase grotesk 700,
    up to about 4-5x body size, tight line-height, running nearly to the hard border —
    e.g. "AUTHOR PROMPTS. ORCHESTRATE AGENTS." One word knocked out in a solid vermilion
    block, another sitting on a hazard-yellow block, black text on each. A short
    plain-black sub-headline in regular weight below. A thin uppercase mono eyebrow above
    the headline ("PROMPT SYNTAX, FULL VOLTAGE"). A CTA ROW: a solid vermilion
    "GET STARTED" primary button with black border and hard-offset block shadow beside a
    white bordered "LOG IN" secondary button.

    FEATURE GRID (below hero): four hard-bordered rectangular cells butted together,
    separated by 1px black rules, zero radius — one each for SESSIONS, TICKETS, CHAT, and
    PERSONAS. Each cell has a big uppercase grotesk title, a one-line mono descriptor, and
    a small flat monochrome glyph. One cell carries a solid ultramarine fill with white
    text as an accent; the rest are white with black text.

    FOOTER (bottom, bordered band): grouped uppercase mono nav links (DOCS, PROTOCOL,
    CONTACT, STATUS) and a small "NPL" mark; flat, hard, no ornament.

    PALETTE & TYPE: pure white canvas, pure black ink and borders at full strength (never
    a faint hairline), electric vermilion as the primary accent, pure ultramarine blue and
    hazard yellow as secondary blocks — each flat and whole at maximum saturation, no tints
    or blends. Space Grotesk for headings and UI (uppercase, heavy), Space Mono for labels,
    links, and descriptors. No serif.

    SHAPE & SURFACE: zero corner radius on everything; 1-2px solid black borders on every
    block, button, and card; the only depth is a solid hard-offset block shadow (down-right,
    zero blur) under the primary buttons and one pulled-forward card. Absolutely no gradient,
    glow, blur, or soft shadow.

    MOOD: loud, raw, structural, high-voltage — disciplined by a hard grid, not chaotic.
    This tool does not apologize for taking up space.
  negative: "watermark, signature, lorem ipsum placeholder text, low-fidelity wireframe, monitor/device photograph framing, photorealistic, 3D render, blurry, distorted UI, rounded corners, drop-shadow blur, soft shadow, gradient, neon glow, pastel colors, frosted glass"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1920
    height: 1080
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.72
  criteria:
    relevance: {weight: 3, description: "Matches the landing page's actual layout — bordered nav bar, huge hero banner with a CTA button group, four-cell feature grid (Sessions/Tickets/Chat/Personas), footer"}
    theme_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Brutalist language — zero radius, full-strength solid black borders, flat electric vermilion/ultramarine/hazard-yellow blocks at max saturation, hard-offset block shadow (zero blur) as the only depth, Space Grotesk uppercase headings + Space Mono, no serif, no gradient/glow/soft shadow"}
    composition: {weight: 2, description: "Clear visual hierarchy on a hard grid, oversized shouting headline, plausible real-product landing layout"}
    technical: {weight: 2, description: "Sharp, correct 16:9 aspect, legible text, no artifacts"}
  reject_if:
    - "lorem ipsum or placeholder text visible"
    - "watermark or signature visible"
    - "wireframe-level fidelity instead of high-fidelity mockup"
    - "rounded corners, soft/blurred drop shadow, gradient, glow, or frosted glass present"

tags: [npl-brutalist, NoizuPromptLingo, screen-mockup, landing-page, hero]
